</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50231,"threadID":3782,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1474300651,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1474302975,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>as Oxygen mentioned, I don&#x27;t have the ability to access the database, otherwise I would&#x27;ve done it already.<br>We apologize that we are taking so long to fulfill your request.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a> <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a><br>Server: Knife<br>SteamID: STEAM_1:1:87681368<br>Reset !rank.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Thanks.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50234,"threadID":3782,"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","subject":"","time":1474301895,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":7,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1474307240,"value":1},{"userID":2,"username":"Sky","time":1474308021,"value":1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1474315557,"value":1},{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1474321088,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1474365410,"value":1},{"userID":2039,"username":"Wario","time":1474375811,"value":1},{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1489065183,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Yeah! Right!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br>Why won&#x27;t you leave <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a> alone! He&#x27;s very busy... doing Community-Leader-Things... such as... <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/xK00SBv.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><u>playing Rogue Legacy?! As well as playing ShellSshock Live and a wee bit of Rocket League too</u></a><u></u>?! <br>Hmm... this isn&#x27;t really shining a good light on him... <br>I bet he&#x27;s also very busy being on most of his own CSGO servers to <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/4ohiFbs.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><u>PUNISH those damn cheaters and others who violate the rules</u></a><u></u>! Oh wait, what? No? He doesn&#x27;t do that much? <br>Well leave him alone already! <br>At least he probably <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/00eJwRN.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><u>works on some good news for the Dream Community already</u></a><u></u>! For sure he does that! Wait, are you 100% positive? He himself doesn&#x27;t do those either regularly?!<br>OH MY GOD PLEASE KEVIN I CAN&#x27;T WORK UNDER THESE CIRCUMSTANCES... I QUIT MY JOB DEFENDING YOU!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50246,"threadID":3782,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1474320732,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1474321081,"value":1},{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1474337406,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2233-quemzi/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Quemzi</a>,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>I just heard back from Sky, that we usually don&#x27;t do rank resets. The reason being good players getting themselves reset and then demolishing all the other players and basically taking their rank points since they are now at a lower rank. If we do resets, it&#x27;s usually very rare and with a very good reason behind it.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Sorry, that we can&#x27;t help you out.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Greetings,<br>Nachtfrische</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[closesnew*]</span></p>","polls":[]}]}